  "{reg}: connect only the battery to IN+/IN−, measure OUT+/OUT− with the multimeter and turn the trim screw until it reads {v} V.": "{reg}: conecte solo la batería a IN+/IN−, mida OUT+/OUT− con el multímetro y gire el tornillo de ajuste hasta que marque {v} V.",
